        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "Was charged 72$ to remove a piece of plastic hanging on by a single bolt…\nIf I wasn’t too pregnant to manœuvre I would’ve ripped it off myself but had no choice and didn’t want to be dragging around plastic and polluting the highway. Felt way over charged for something that should’ve taken a minute.\n\nIt was my second time visiting. The first time I also felt overcharged, but wanted to give the benefit of the doubt as they are reasonable walking distance from my work.\n\nI will not be returning.",
        "time": 1739965844,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Laurie-ann Naughton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101363601787278208300/reviews",
