        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I wish that I had these reviews. Would have saved 2k. Be wary, was told my car was ‘like new’ but my check engine light that was on previously was still on. He said you didn’t ask us to check that. I did. The alignment they said was done, wasn’t. I drove for 5 minutes, went back but no one could go on a road test because the owner had gone out. Extremely disappointed. Took it elsewhere for tires, they couldn’t believe what I had been charged. Terrible.",
        "time": 1703391940,
        "translated": false
